    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>｜开场与嘉宾介绍 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>｜为何最初决定来美国 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>｜从“找份好工作”到“找适合我的工作” </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>｜博士毕业后的转念：从坚持留美到回国做研究 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a>｜媛：从回国干事业到再次出国的反思 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>｜Mia：在迷茫与现实中兜转，最终找到节奏 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>｜如何判断当前的选择是对的？ </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a>｜职业选择就像中医饮食：只有你知道自己吃什么最舒服 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a>｜迷茫期是“重新建构自我”的黄金时段 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">73:00</a>｜Ting：底层安全感塌陷时如何重新整合自我 </span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">81:00</a>｜结尾感言：每个人的路径都是独一无二的</span><br><span></span><br><span>本期嘉宾：一苇医生、Mia、媛、Ting</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Max</span></p>]]></description>
